# Example packages carry fixed content digests: manifest.integrity for page plugins and
# generated .ddnative package integrity over ui.html. A checkout that rewrites line endings
# (core.autocrlf on Windows runners) would change those bytes and fail integrity verification,
# so these sources are pinned to LF in every checkout.
examples/page-plugin/* text eol=lf
examples/native-process/* text eol=lf
examples/native-process/**/* text eol=lf
